  "result": "The reviewer agent can no longer modify files. I changed `.claude/agents/reviewer.md` in three ways:\n\n- **Took `Edit` out of `tools`.** The reviewer now only has `Read, Grep, Glob`.\n- **Removed `memory: project`.** Turning on memory quietly gives the agent Write and Edit so it can save its memory files. Leaving it on would have let the reviewer keep write access.\n- **Added `disallowedTools: Write, Edit, MultiEdit, NotebookEdit, Bash`.** This is a second safeguard: those tools stay blocked even if someone adds them back to `tools` later. `Bash` is on the list because it can also write files.\n\nThe tradeoff is that the reviewer won't remember anything between sessions any more. If you want that back, it can't also be strictly read-only.\n\nI didn't run `npm run lint` or `npm run build`, since this only changes agent config and no app code.",
